  <name>ToolsBoXApp</name>
  <summary>Offline desktop utility toolbox</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      ToolsBoXApp brings the ToolsBoXMachine collection of everyday utilities
      directly to your desktop as a standalone, native application.
    </p>
    <p>
      All tools run locally on your system, allowing you to use them without an
      active internet connection:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Text utilities, notes, and emoji keyboard</li>
      <li>Calculators, countdowns, and timers</li>
      <li>QR code generators and password generators</li>
      <li>Image manipulation tools and more</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
